WEBVTT

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.270
Zola...

00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:55.303
Zola!

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:56.800
Prepare yourself!

00:01:56.833 --> 00:01:58.103
Prepare! Prepare!

00:01:58.133 --> 00:01:59.703
No! Delphinium!

00:02:13.033 --> 00:02:14.433
You're mine!

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.100
ZOLA

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:45.870
Zola...

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:49.130
Tell me, Zola!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.500
What the hell happened?!

00:02:51.633 --> 00:02:52.903
Just what you see.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.830
The seal of the Darkness
has been broken

00:02:54.866 --> 00:02:57.566
and the world is being
absorbed by it.

00:02:58.900 --> 00:02:59.570
Zola...

00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:01.503
But you must've had a reason!

00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:04.003
There must've been a reason
why you did this!

00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:05.126
That's right!

00:03:05.266 --> 00:03:08.066
You'd never do something
like this without a reason!

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:10.230
Who's blackmailing you, maro?!

00:03:10.366 --> 00:03:14.126
It's unfortunate for you guys,
but this is what I wanted...

00:03:14.533 --> 00:03:16.673
Nobody told me to do this.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.500
Were you using us from the start?!

00:03:24.133 --> 00:03:27.333
If that's how you want to take it,
so be it.

00:03:27.866 --> 00:03:29.566
But I will say this much...

00:03:29.733 --> 00:03:31.873
Everything that I've done
on this journey

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.230
was solely to bring
back the Darkness.

00:03:34.866 --> 00:03:36.866
So everything went
as you planned, huh?!

00:03:38.966 --> 00:03:41.366
Taking us on the journey...

00:03:42.566 --> 00:03:45.166
The first time we infiltrated
the Grankingdom...

00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:48.303
Getting us to gain power...

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.000
And defeating Nene...

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:56.173
Was it all part of your plan?!

00:03:56.900 --> 00:03:59.700
I think you have the wrong idea.

00:04:00.233 --> 00:04:00.903
What?!

00:04:01.966 --> 00:04:06.066
I didn't force you guys
to do anything.

00:04:06.433 --> 00:04:10.103
Did you not make your own decisions
at every step of the way?

00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:11.796
That's not the truth.

00:04:12.666 --> 00:04:14.496
You just didn't force them
using words.

00:04:14.833 --> 00:04:16.673
You definitely manipulated
these children

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.430
to achieve your ends.

00:04:19.233 --> 00:04:21.333
There's no denying that.

00:04:21.866 --> 00:04:22.526
Indeed.

00:04:22.566 --> 00:04:27.166
You did act according to
my scenario after all, Logi...

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:31.030
Zola, what is your objective?

00:04:31.666 --> 00:04:33.866
What is in it for you for
doing something like this?

00:04:34.866 --> 00:04:38.566
Something like this?
What exactly are you referring to?

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.870
I'm asking why you're
trying to have

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:42.730
the Darkness
consume the world!

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:44.370
Why! Why!

00:04:45.366 --> 00:04:47.626
This is what I wanted.

00:04:47.933 --> 00:04:49.533
I will restore normalcy

00:04:49.566 --> 00:04:51.596
by letting the Darkness
take the reign once again.

00:04:52.200 --> 00:04:55.470
That is the world as it should be.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:01.170
But...that's...

00:05:01.733 --> 00:05:03.633
Shu, do you remember?

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:06.000
I told you in the beginning...

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.900
You're a Knight Master, right?

00:05:09.433 --> 00:05:12.573
Unfortunately,
I am not a Knight Master.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:16.730
And, if I speak in philosophical
terms of good and bad...

00:05:16.933 --> 00:05:19.503
I may not even be your ally.

00:05:21.533 --> 00:05:22.973
So what about it?!

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.170
This world is everything
I believe in.

00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:33.873
Jiro! No!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:36.270
Zola!

00:05:36.666 --> 00:05:37.666
Why?!

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:46.800
Jiro...

00:05:47.500 --> 00:05:49.200
I told you many times.

00:05:49.300 --> 00:05:51.370
Don't let your emotions
control you.

00:05:54.866 --> 00:05:57.726
Let me tell you guys
something good.

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.800
What could you possibly
have to say now?

00:06:02.133 --> 00:06:04.803
You're attempting to
destroy the world.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:07.230
That act alone is...

00:06:10.066 --> 00:06:11.066
Maro?

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:14.300
Let's hear it.

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.100
Very well...

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:19.500
I'll tell you the truth about
how the world was created.

00:06:22.866 --> 00:06:27.826
Long ago, a great light was cast
and the world was created.

00:06:29.866 --> 00:06:33.196
Light overflowed and
shone in every corner.

00:06:33.766 --> 00:06:40.866
The beautiful world brought forth
and flourished many living things.

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:43.000
The world of light...

00:06:43.766 --> 00:06:46.766
Its prosperity seemed
to last forever.

00:06:47.566 --> 00:06:51.266
However, foolish humans
desired not only light,

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.670
but darkness as well.

00:06:53.533 --> 00:06:57.873
Their wish was granted,
and darkness appeared.

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:00.370
It was the instant that

00:07:00.400 --> 00:07:02.430
the Darkness was
born in this world.

00:07:05.566 --> 00:07:08.296
That's the prologue from
the Book of the Beginning...

00:07:09.166 --> 00:07:10.426
What's your point?

00:07:10.933 --> 00:07:15.203
People say that light came first
as if it were destined to be.

00:07:15.566 --> 00:07:17.026
But that isn't the truth.

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.030
Humanity fabricated the story
that light came first

00:07:20.066 --> 00:07:22.626
to better suit themselves.

00:07:24.600 --> 00:07:26.870
Light can't exist
without the Darkness.

00:07:27.433 --> 00:07:29.433
The truth was just the opposite.

00:07:29.633 --> 00:07:31.833
The Darkness is what came first.

00:07:33.033 --> 00:07:35.803
It was the Darkness
that controlled the world.

00:07:42.166 --> 00:07:44.696
Is that a big deal, maro?

00:07:44.866 --> 00:07:47.466
Long before mankind
ever even came into being...

00:07:47.866 --> 00:07:52.396
The Darkness reigned over
this world as its supreme ruler.

00:07:54.133 --> 00:07:56.203
In the course of evolution,

00:07:56.233 --> 00:07:59.433
the Darkness morphed
into various forms.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:05.600
And one of the mutations
was the Shadow Wielder...

00:08:05.666 --> 00:08:06.326
That can't be!

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:10.130
Are you saying that Shadow Wielders
were born from the Darkness?!

00:08:10.733 --> 00:08:11.833
Exactly.

00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:14.733
We were born from the Darkness.

00:08:15.366 --> 00:08:17.696
Shadow Wielders and mankind

00:08:17.733 --> 00:08:20.133
would not have come into being
without the Darkness.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.930
The Shadow Wielders were
an entirely new species.

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.300
When they came into being,

00:08:27.333 --> 00:08:29.503
they were not considered to be
a threat to the Darkness.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:33.800
However, the Shadow Wielders
grew in number

00:08:33.833 --> 00:08:36.903
and soon gave birth to
the subspecies known as mankind...

00:08:37.733 --> 00:08:40.033
The Shadow Wielders
who had grown in number

00:08:40.066 --> 00:08:41.826
formed a faction with humanity.

00:08:42.533 --> 00:08:45.403
And they had the audacity to wage
a war against the Darkness...

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:49.900
As expected, the war was
in favor of the Darkness...

00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:53.173
After all, the Shadow Wielders
only had a small portion

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:55.430
of the vast power that was
available to the Darkness.

00:08:57.133 --> 00:09:00.733
As the Shadow Wielders and
humans declined in number,

00:09:00.766 --> 00:09:03.766
it appeared that the war would end
with a landslide victory by the Darkness.

00:09:04.566 --> 00:09:07.526
However,
the seven Soldiers of Light,

00:09:07.566 --> 00:09:10.696
the Shadow Wielders with
outstanding power appeared...

00:09:25.433 --> 00:09:26.103
That's right.

00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:30.166
The Darkness was sealed away
by your ancestors.

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:37.170
The Soldiers of Light
used their power artfully

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.600
and sent the world
in the wrong direction.

00:09:44.033 --> 00:09:46.403
The mistake must be corrected.

00:09:49.466 --> 00:09:52.126
I will fix this error

00:09:52.166 --> 00:09:54.666
and return the world to the form
it was originally intended to be.

00:09:56.133 --> 00:10:00.603
I will not tolerate anyone
who gets in my way.

00:10:01.166 --> 00:10:06.096
So you'll even fight
these children?

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:08.630
No way! That's a lie!

00:10:08.866 --> 00:10:12.026
You... You would never say
something like that!

00:10:15.033 --> 00:10:16.833
There must be a reason, right?!

00:10:17.033 --> 00:10:20.373
Is someone controlling you?!
Is someone threatening you?!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:23.230
If so, we can help you!

00:10:26.666 --> 00:10:27.666
Please...

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.730
Go back to the way you were.

00:10:30.533 --> 00:10:31.533
Bouquet...

00:10:32.166 --> 00:10:33.166
Zola...

00:10:48.433 --> 00:10:49.433
Zola...

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.170
It seems words are
no longer sufficient.

00:11:30.633 --> 00:11:32.673
You should be satisfied now, Shu.

00:11:34.066 --> 00:11:35.096
I agree.

00:11:36.566 --> 00:11:37.226
Zola!

00:11:40.733 --> 00:11:42.773
I want you to tell me
just one last thing.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.000
I want you to tell me
just one last thing.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:02.700
Were we ever friends?

00:12:09.666 --> 00:12:13.266
No... We're not friends.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:14.670
Shu!

00:12:15.166 --> 00:12:16.196
Maro.

00:12:26.733 --> 00:12:28.903
I believed this whole time.

00:12:29.266 --> 00:12:30.896
Make me your apprentice!

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.630
I believed this whole time that
no matter what happened,

00:12:35.666 --> 00:12:37.066
we would always be friends.

00:12:42.366 --> 00:12:43.366
This whole time...

00:12:47.333 --> 00:12:48.773
That's why...

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:52.870
Zola!

00:12:53.266 --> 00:12:55.326
As a friend, I'll stop you!

00:12:55.766 --> 00:12:58.866
You're resolute as ever, huh?

00:12:59.133 --> 00:13:00.203
Interesting.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.470
Bring it!

00:13:03.033 --> 00:13:04.303
Let's go, guys!

00:13:36.333 --> 00:13:37.333
Hippo!

00:13:37.366 --> 00:13:38.366
Right!

00:13:56.433 --> 00:13:58.303
Maro!

00:13:58.333 --> 00:13:59.903
You're okay with this, right?

00:14:00.533 --> 00:14:01.533
Zola!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.000
Minotaur!

00:14:14.400 --> 00:14:16.770
We're going to stop Zola!
Got it?!

00:14:24.700 --> 00:14:28.070
Killer Bat, you'll make
a worthy opponent!

00:14:28.366 --> 00:14:30.196
Zola!

00:14:32.266 --> 00:14:32.926
What?!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:37.370
Don't underestimate
the power of the Darkness.

00:14:43.133 --> 00:14:45.273
Maro!

00:14:50.033 --> 00:14:50.703
Maro...

00:14:53.433 --> 00:14:54.833
Saber Tiger.

00:14:55.166 --> 00:14:58.096
Your exceptional speed
is indeed effective,

00:14:58.133 --> 00:15:00.273
but you lack the power to bring
down your opponent in one blow.

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:01.500
Marumaro!

00:15:01.533 --> 00:15:05.603
Maro!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.200
What're you doing?! Attack!

00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:19.530
Go!

00:15:31.566 --> 00:15:32.566
Phoenix!

00:15:36.833 --> 00:15:40.403
Phoenix, your defensive strength
is impressive.

00:15:48.433 --> 00:15:51.903
But you can't deploy shields to
multiple locations simultaneously.

00:15:53.366 --> 00:15:54.696
Hippopotamus.

00:15:58.333 --> 00:16:00.203
You can't win a battle
against the Darkness

00:16:00.233 --> 00:16:02.273
with your powers of
transformation alone.

00:16:02.533 --> 00:16:03.203
Right...

00:16:05.166 --> 00:16:06.766
We must stay closer to each other.

00:16:07.066 --> 00:16:09.526
We must keep close and
cover each other's blind spots!

00:16:09.866 --> 00:16:11.196
I'll stop Zola!

00:16:11.233 --> 00:16:12.233
Me too!

00:16:12.566 --> 00:16:13.566
Hold it!

00:16:14.733 --> 00:16:16.133
Don't you find it strange?

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:16.970
What?

00:16:17.433 --> 00:16:19.873
Why doesn't she finish them off?

00:16:20.066 --> 00:16:21.726
Why! Why!

00:16:30.066 --> 00:16:33.696
All of this would end if she
just took one of us down...

00:16:36.066 --> 00:16:38.726
Does she still have
something planned for us?

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.030
Or perhaps she still has emotions
like an ordinary person?

00:16:43.066 --> 00:16:44.066
Ordinary person?

00:16:44.366 --> 00:16:46.566
I'm not sure if she's even
a person anymore.

00:16:46.733 --> 00:16:48.233
Not sure! Not sure!

00:16:48.633 --> 00:16:52.973
But we have to settle this before
she has a change of heart!

00:16:57.566 --> 00:16:59.726
Everyone's just doing
whatever they want!

00:17:09.266 --> 00:17:10.566
Minotaur.

00:17:10.833 --> 00:17:13.773
Your power is truly superb.
However...

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:16.530
Waves of Rage!

00:17:26.033 --> 00:17:28.673
I know your moves already.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:29.870
Zola!

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.070
How careless.

00:17:43.133 --> 00:17:46.233
I'm now blessed with
the power of the Darkness.

00:18:06.266 --> 00:18:11.866
It seems you're the one...
who got careless, Zola!

00:18:23.266 --> 00:18:23.926
What?!

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.000
Don't you understand?

00:18:38.166 --> 00:18:41.766
The Darkness is far beyond
your imaginations.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:44.070
Zo...

00:18:59.566 --> 00:19:03.596
I knew that you guys would rise up.

00:19:14.066 --> 00:19:18.096
Jiro, you sought strength,
did you not?

00:19:18.900 --> 00:19:20.870
What have you gained
from that strength?

00:19:21.433 --> 00:19:23.933
Have you gained anything from
carrying out your revenge?

00:19:24.533 --> 00:19:25.803
Shut up!

00:19:28.066 --> 00:19:28.726
Shu...

00:19:30.366 --> 00:19:33.296
You were fighting to
protect everyone and

00:19:33.333 --> 00:19:36.303
to keep sadness from
spreading, right?

00:19:37.833 --> 00:19:41.473
You're now responsible for
so much sadness in the world!

00:19:41.733 --> 00:19:42.903
Do you understand that?!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.600
You're wrong.

00:19:49.966 --> 00:19:50.626
Huh?!

00:19:53.666 --> 00:19:56.626
By allowing the Darkness
to take over,

00:19:56.666 --> 00:19:59.166
all conflict and sadness
will be gone.

00:19:59.633 --> 00:20:03.103
Concern over useless emotions
will be no more.

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:05.030
By surrendering yourself
to the Darkness...

00:20:05.133 --> 00:20:07.003
By letting the Darkness
take the reign,

00:20:07.033 --> 00:20:09.703
the various antinomies running
rampant in the human world

00:20:09.733 --> 00:20:10.733
will be no more.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:15.930
An orderly and righteous world
lies there.

00:20:17.166 --> 00:20:19.796
Then why does the Darkness
absorb people?

00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:24.996
Of course there won't be
conflict or struggle

00:20:25.033 --> 00:20:27.873
if everything gets swallowed up
and there's nothing left.

00:20:28.266 --> 00:20:34.126
You can't have conflict when
there's nobody left in the world.

00:20:42.333 --> 00:20:46.233
Zola, I've never been able to
understand complicated things...

00:20:48.966 --> 00:20:50.826
But I do understand this!

00:20:51.033 --> 00:20:52.533
- A world like that
- A world like that

00:20:52.566 --> 00:20:54.326
- is meaningless to us!
- is meaningless to us!

00:20:56.533 --> 00:20:58.573
Shu! Let's settle this now!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:20:59.900
Yeah!

00:20:59.933 --> 00:21:03.433
We've gotta put everything
into this one shot!

00:21:03.766 --> 00:21:05.626
Conquer!

00:21:09.833 --> 00:21:12.033
Blue Explosion!

00:21:21.533 --> 00:21:23.403
- Go!
- Go!

00:21:43.466 --> 00:21:44.696
No way.

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.400
She stopped that with
her bare hands?!

00:21:47.666 --> 00:21:51.926
You've gotta be kidding...
She stopped our best shot.

00:21:54.566 --> 00:21:59.496
This is the power of the Darkness.
Don't you think it's wonderful?

00:22:03.300 --> 00:22:05.470
It seems words aren't
enough to convince you.

00:22:06.733 --> 00:22:09.303
If that's the case, then get
a firsthand taste of it yourself!

00:22:10.733 --> 00:22:12.333
How inconvenient.

00:22:12.666 --> 00:22:14.296
You can't even get
inside the Darkness

00:22:14.333 --> 00:22:16.073
without the help
of a machine.

00:22:17.900 --> 00:22:19.470
I'll be busting that.

00:22:31.966 --> 00:22:33.426
What's this?!

00:22:33.800 --> 00:22:36.070
I'm being eaten...by the Darkness?!

00:22:36.366 --> 00:22:38.026
Shu!

00:24:18.466 --> 00:24:21.966
Shu is absorbed by the Darkness
and becomes one with Blue Dragon.

00:24:22.000 --> 00:24:23.130
It's Shu on the inside,

00:24:23.166 --> 00:24:24.866
but it's Blue Dragon
on the outside, maro.

00:24:24.900 --> 00:24:27.730
I know I look different,
but let's get along, okay?

00:24:27.766 --> 00:24:28.766
Yikes, look out!

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:29.800
Stay away.

00:24:29.833 --> 00:24:32.573
Goodbye, Shu.
I can't marry a dragon.

00:24:32.633 --> 00:24:34.673
What ever happened to our bonds?

00:24:34.933 --> 00:24:36.973
Next on Blue Dragon:
Bonds
